  ],
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p00000-4dc6742d",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "text": "Mara reached the stone bridge and placed a lantern on the wall.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 63
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00001-7c894f36",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "text": "Rowan watched her from the gate. He kept his sword in its sheath.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 65,
        "char_end": 130
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00002-b6a414ed",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "text": "\"Will you open the gate?\" Mara asked Rowan.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 132,
        "char_end": 175
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 25,
          "text": "\"Will you open the gate?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00003-7957dcd5",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "text": "\"No,\" Rowan answered. \"I will not let the soldiers through.\"",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 177,
        "char_end": 237
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "text": "\"No,\""
        },
        {
          "start": 22,
          "end": 60,
          "text": "\"I will not let the soldiers through.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004-3c2fbe8e",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "text": "Mara planned to return before sunrise, but she had not yet left the bridge.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 239,
        "char_end": 314
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00005-3ae4f9f1",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "text": "The lantern glass was green. Mist lay over the river.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 316,
        "char_end": 369
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00006-d6095cad",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "text": "Rowan checked the lock every evening before he went home.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 371,
        "char_end": 428
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007-80579766",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "text": "\"Last winter I hid three children in the mill,\" Mara said.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 430,
        "char_end": 488
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 47,
          "text": "\"Last winter I hid three children in the mill,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00008-304e26be",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "text": "\"I heard that Rowan sold the map,\" said Iven. \"I did not see it happen.\"",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 490,
        "char_end": 562
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 34,
          "text": "\"I heard that Rowan sold the map,\""
        },
        {
          "start": 46,
          "end": 72,
          "text": "\"I did not see it happen.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00009-34f53a39",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "text": "\"I never betrayed my friends,\" Rowan said. Nobody answered his claim.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 564,
        "char_end": 633
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 30,
          "text": "\"I never betrayed my friends,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00010-67c3d0da",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "text": "Mara stayed by the gate because she wanted the children to reach safety.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 635,
        "char_end": 707
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00011-8e6a8ffe",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "text": "When the bell rang, Iven flinched and dropped his cup.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 709,
        "char_end": 763
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00012-c66f1d9d",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "text": "Rowan and Iven entered the yard. He lifted the lantern.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 765,
        "char_end": 820
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00013-d72f6cf3",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "text": "The man who lifted it was Iven; Rowan had been carrying the blankets.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 822,
        "char_end": 891
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00014-e61731d7",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "text": "\"They call me Ash,\" Mara told the guard. \"That is my old nickname.\"",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 893,
        "char_end": 960
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 19,
          "text": "\"They call me Ash,\""
        },
        {
          "start": 41,
          "end": 67,
          "text": "\"That is my old nickname.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00015-6d2e0bd5",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "text": "\"Ash, take the blankets,\" Rowan said to Mara.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 962,
        "char_end": 1007
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 25,
          "text": "\"Ash, take the blankets,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00016-78b50b70",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "text": "Mara accepted the blankets but refused the silver coin.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1009,
        "char_end": 1064
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00017-f21d773d",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "text": "\"Can we cross the river tonight?\" Iven asked.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1066,
        "char_end": 1111
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 33,
          "text": "\"Can we cross the river tonight?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00018-82364d09",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "text": "\"Only after the bell,\" Mara replied. \"Wait beside the mill.\"",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1113,
        "char_end": 1173
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 22,
          "text": "\"Only after the bell,\""
        },
        {
          "start": 37,
          "end": 60,
          "text": "\"Wait beside the mill.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00019-b0d084f4",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "text": "The discussion turned to food. Rowan asked whether any bread remained.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1175,
        "char_end": 1245
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00020-0570f388",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "text": "Iven gave Rowan half a loaf and kept the rest for the children.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1247,
        "char_end": 1310
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00021-d4282aff",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "text": "Years earlier, Rowan had chosen to abandon a paid post rather than arrest his sister.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1312,
        "char_end": 1397
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00022-a62fd3b1",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "text": "\"He always pays his debts,\" Mara said of Rowan. It was her opinion, not the narrator's guarantee.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1399,
        "char_end": 1496
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 27,
          "text": "\"He always pays his debts,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00023-6161be9b",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "text": "Iven considered stealing a horse, then decided against it.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1498,
        "char_end": 1556
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00024-39573c99",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "text": "A broken cart stood beside the empty stable. Its wheels were covered in dust.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1558,
        "char_end": 1635
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00025-ae7dacb6",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "text": "At dawn Mara entered the mill alone. She found an unsigned letter on the table.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1637,
        "char_end": 1716
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00026-5a8c702b",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "text": "The letter said, \"I moved the children before midnight.\" No name identified its writer.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1718,
        "char_end": 1805
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 17,
          "end": 56,
          "text": "\"I moved the children before midnight.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00027-cac2a4c9",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "text": "Mara folded the letter. She did not know whether its claim was true.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1807,
        "char_end": 1875
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00028-bd0086ac",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "text": "Rowan arrived and said, \"I meant to warn you, but the gate was locked.\"",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1877,
        "char_end": 1948
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 24,
          "end": 71,
          "text": "\"I meant to warn you, but the gate was locked.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00029-c9753cbc",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "text": "Mara stepped away from him when she heard the news.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 1950,
        "char_end": 2001
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00030-14f10584",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "text": "\"I will search the western road,\" Iven said. He remained in the doorway.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 2003,
        "char_end": 2075
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "mixed",
      "dialogue_spans": [
        {
          "start": 0,
          "end": 33,
          "text": "\"I will search the western road,\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00031-92135bf5",
      "section_id": "s000",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "text": "The rain stopped. The three stood quietly until the bell rang again.",
      "origin": {
        "char_start": 2077,
        "char_end": 2145
      },
      "element_type": "text",
      "type": "narration",
      "dialogue_spans": []
    }
  ],
  "offset_convention": "Unicode code points; spans are paragraph-local, end-exclusive; origin locates document block"
}
